Cell["\<\
\[EmptySmallCircle] \:feff\:feffMetric compatibility : The tetrad formalism \
uses a tetrad (or vierbein) to connect the curved spacetime to a local flat, \
Lorentzian frame . The connection coefficients are defined to satisfy the \
metric compatibility condition for the tetrad, which is : \[EmptySmallCircle] \
\:feff\:feffV
\:043d\:0435 \"
v=0
\[Bullet] Here, Vu is the covariant derivative with respect to the connection \
F\" bv, and ea v is
the tetrad component .\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970214910665941*^9, 
  3.970214915432437*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"42cf875b-e526-4085-9797-\
6e7eaeb7d251"],

